Future Retro Fusion PicoDriveRGB is a modified/derivative PicoDrive distribution.

The PicoDrive redistribution terms are reproduced in COPYING_PICODRIVE and are
the governing terms for the PicoDrive-derived distribution. The authoritative
public repository must also retain the upstream PicoDrive COPYING file unchanged.

Future Retro Fusion port changes are distributed as part of that derivative
source tree under the PicoDrive redistribution terms where those terms apply.
File-level third-party notices in the upstream PicoDrive/libretro sources remain
applicable and must not be removed.
